# Normalize all text files to LF, everywhere — including Windows checkouts.
#
# Added with BUG-001: this is a Windows working tree, and without this file
# autocrlf manufactures CRLF on checkout. CRLF + a shebang broke vitest's
# loader on tools/ingest_material_budget.mjs, silently benching an entire
# test suite for weeks (the suite "failed to parse" and collected 0 tests,
# which reads like one flaky file rather than a feature with no coverage).
# Repo-wide on purpose — the class dies here, not just the one instance.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never touch line endings.
*.xlsx binary
*.png binary
